  "policy_conclusion": "No blocker to diagnostic002. Do not promote by merely removing padstack from CRITICAL_CHECKS: any padstack/padstack_invalid finding must independently reject across route, strategy trials, result checking and application while raw severities remain unchanged. Ignore/excluded states remain unsupported. Diagnostic policy intentionally blocks critical findings even when severity is warning.",
